OL,3,GNEWSADog walkers without poo bags to
OL,4,Aface #100 fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FDog walkers in an East Sussex town are
OL,7,Fto face #100 fines if they fail to
OL,8,Fcarry poo bags under new council plans.
OL,10,FHastings Borough Council's cabinet has
OL,11,Fvoted in favour of extending the town's
OL,12,FDog Control Public Space Protection
OL,13,FOrder (PSPO) for three years.
OL,15,FAs well as renewing current
OL,16,Frestrictions, such as ordering owners
OL,17,Fto clear up dog mess, the new condition
OL,18,Fwill also make it an offence to be
OL,19,Ffound without "suitable means to remove
OL,20,Fdog faeces".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
