OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADog walkers without poo bags to
OL,4,Aface #100 fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FBecca Horne, cabinet member for
OL,7,Fcommunity safety and environmental
OL,8,Fservices, said it was not about "coming
OL,9,Fdown hard on people" financially, but
OL,10,Frather a "real deterrent" to potential
OL,11,Foffenders.
